fp5-modemmanager @V@: /usr/sbin/ModemManager rebuilt from Debian modemmanager 1.25.95-1 (experimental source, same
configure flags as debian/rules, built 21 Nov 2026; re-pinned for each BengalOS version by fp5-feed-auto, which checks
the official modemmanager package is still 1.25.95-1 and every symbol resolves against that version's /usr) plus
upstream commit 9317cbc4 "netlink: fix use-after-free calling completion_fn on transaction completion" (MM issue 1110)
and local patch mm-fp5-keep-ims-bearer.
9317cbc4 fixes the ModemManager SIGSEGV when a data bearer creates its qmapmux link. mm-fp5-keep-ims-bearer makes
Simple.Disconnect of "/" skip a bearer whose apn-type includes IMS, whose APN is "ims", or whose profile-id is 2
(the bearer fp5-imsd creates). Only the daemon is replaced; plugins, libmm-glib, units and config stay official.
Do not drop this sysext merely because upstream contains 9317cbc4: the IMS spare is local.
